From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:06:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath10k: skip calibration prefetch on SDIO

Skip the calibration prefetch operation for the SDIO transport while
retaining it for the other bus types.

Original author was not recorded in the imported patch.
[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath10k/core.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath10k/core.c
@@ -3587,7 +3587,8 @@ int ath10k_core_register(struct ath10k *
 	 * Forcing the work to be done immediately works around this problem
 	 * but may also delay the boot when firmware images cannot be found.
 	 */
-	flush_workqueue(ar->workqueue);
+	if (ar->hif.bus != ATH10K_BUS_SDIO)
+		flush_workqueue(ar->workqueue);
 
 	return 0;
 }
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath10k/debug.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath10k/debug.c
@@ -1263,6 +1263,9 @@ static int ath10k_debug_cal_data_fetch(s
 	if (ar->hw_params.cal_data_len == 0)
 		return -EOPNOTSUPP;
 
+	if (ar->hif.bus == ATH10K_BUS_SDIO)
+		return -EINVAL;
+
 	hi_addr = host_interest_item_address(HI_ITEM(hi_board_data));
 
 	ret = ath10k_hif_diag_read(ar, hi_addr, &addr, sizeof(addr));
